Upstream source:
    https://github.com/dbt-labs/metricflow
Version vendored:
    v0.209.0 (see __about__.py)

The following three upstream packages were merged into this single
`metricflow.*` namespace:

    - metricflow
    - metricflow-semantics            (vendored as metricflow.semantics.*)
    - metricflow-semantic-interfaces  (vendored as metricflow.semantic_interfaces.*)

Local modifications (per Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b)):

    1. Added `sql/render/doris.py`: a new Doris dialect SQL plan renderer
       (`DorisSqlPlanRenderer`), not present upstream.
    2. Added `msi_pydantic_shim.py`: replaces the upstream
       `dsi_pydantic_shim` module for the merged
       metricflow-semantic-interfaces tree.
    3. Modified `protocols/sql_client.py`: added the `DORIS` member to the
       `SqlEngine` enum and its engine-type mapping.
    4. Modified `semantic_interfaces/implementations/project_configuration.py`:
       patched the default `dsi_package_version` fallback — when the
       `dbt_semantic_interfaces` distribution is not installed it now falls
       back to the `mcp-server` distribution version and finally to "0.0.0",
       instead of failing with PackageNotFoundError.
    5. Rewrote imports throughout the tree: upstream imports of
       `metricflow_semantics.*` and `dbt_semantic_interfaces.*` were rewritten
       to `metricflow.semantics.*` and `metricflow.semantic_interfaces.*`
       respectively, to match the merged single-namespace layout.
